<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-beishi" book-id="b-beishi-016" chapter-id="c-beishi-016-kangzu-mingyuan" source-id="s-beishi-016-kangzu-mingyuan-ws1518816">
  <p id="c-beishi-016-kangzu-mingyuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">明元皇帝七男：杜密皇后生太武皇帝；大慕容夫人生樂平戾王丕；安定殤王彌闕母氏；慕容夫人生樂安宣王範；尹夫人生永昌莊王<persName id="c-beishi-016-kangzu-mingyuan:p001:m0057" ref="19f_55e_8b2_A">健</persName>；建甯王崇、新興王俊二王並闕母氏。</p>
</text>
